leak_needles := "weighs the chance no rival above it reaches the slot|half outbids every searcher that tips less, whoever reaches the slot|which for one that looks only at a pair's two pools may be far less|ride each move while it runs|then fade it once it stops|fading the premiums the crowd's positioning opened|0.45 × 1.45 ≈ 0.65 outbids|weighs the chance no rival above it races it|one tick inside the competitor|backs off after one-sided fills|hold the gap into the reopen"
